      <activity id="83275363-949b-580d-bd19-4fc05abe6d63" activityNameId="c0261ee5-e426-5060-bd8b-133925df1991" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Photovoltaic panel, CIS, Sto, Ventec Artline inlay, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic panel, CIS, Sto, Ventec Artline inlay, at plant
Production of photovoltaic thin film modules by thermal vaporization in vacuum. The modules produced at NICE Solar Energy have a size of 0.72m2. The weight is 20.5kg/m2. The specific maximum power is 95 Wp/m2. with aluminium frame;
Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, copper indium selenide, thin film, CIGS; 
UUID: 4dd27ae2-da99-325c-b25d-2ab3c95ece1a
Electricity use, materials, transport of materials, treatment of production wastes. Disposal after end of life.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Unspecified
Time period: Time of publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Based on literature data and producer information 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4dd27ae2-da99-325c-b25d-2ab3c95ece1a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
